flowchart LR
	RUN["a bash test run returns<br/>142 lines of build output"] --> SIZE["the serialized result crosses both gates:<br/>thresholdBytes 2048 x the terminal multiplier 1,<br/>and autoExpandLimitBytes 102400"]
	SIZE --> CLS["the gate classifies the type - terminal"]
	CLS --> HS["the gate hashes the bytes - sha256-24"]
	HS --> ST["the gate stores the content"]
	ST --> REP["the model-visible result replaced with<br/>the preview line plus the marker"]
